        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Alphabetron</strong>, the neon-drenched, pixel-perfect word-hunting arcade game from an alternate 1984 where dictionaries wear sunglasses and vowels fight dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alphabetron</strong> is a 50-level wordsearch odyssey soaked in retro glory. Search, stretch, and slam your way through themed puzzles while a funky synth soundtrack cheers you on. Find words from categories like space stuff, 80s slang and cartoons, and digital dystopias — all while pretending you're better at spelling than you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Retro 8-bit art with neon arcade vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 50 handcrafted wordsearch levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Smart tile selection (straight-line only, we don’t do wiggly cheating here)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Randomized grids, so you can’t just memorize where “LASERUNICORN” was last time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Steam achievements with witty names and pixel-perfect icons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔊 Bleeps and bloops approved by at least one robot band</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, it’s just a Wordsearch game. But it’s the most unnecessarily awesome Wordsearch you’ll ever play.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Alphabetron</strong>, the neon-drenched, pixel-perfect word-hunting arcade game from an alternate 1984 where dictionaries wear sunglasses and vowels fight dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alphabetron</strong> is a 50-level wordsearch odyssey soaked in retro glory. Search, stretch, and slam your way through themed puzzles while a funky synth soundtrack cheers you on. Find words from categories like space stuff, 80s slang and cartoons, and digital dystopias — all while pretending you're better at spelling than you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Retro 8-bit art with neon arcade vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 50 handcrafted wordsearch levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Smart tile selection (straight-line only, we don’t do wiggly cheating here)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Randomized grids, so you can’t just memorize where “LASERUNICORN” was last time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Steam achievements with witty names and pixel-perfect icons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔊 Bleeps and bloops approved by at least one robot band</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, it’s just a Wordsearch game. But it’s the most unnecessarily awesome Wordsearch you’ll ever play.</p>",
